1
00:00:01,540 --> 00:00:02,670
Come on!

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,260
No, it's a spinning pass to Hyuga-kun.

3
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:10,340
This is yours, Hyuga-kun.

4
00:00:10,630 --> 00:00:12,300
Tsubasa showed he trusts me.

5
00:00:12,390 --> 00:00:15,760
He turned his Drive Shot into a spinning pass.

6
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:17,220
Right here.

7
00:00:19,640 --> 00:00:21,230
Scoring this,

8
00:00:21,310 --> 00:00:25,060
is the only way for me to become the true best forward of the Japan team.

9
00:00:26,230 --> 00:00:27,440
Come on!

10
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:32,910
Tiger Shot!

11
00:00:39,330 --> 00:00:43,420
Goal! This is Japan's first goal from the counterattack.

12
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:44,960
It was pure iron will!

13
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:46,210
Beautiful!

14
00:00:48,710 --> 00:00:50,590
Yes! They scored one!

15
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:53,550
Tsubasa! Hyuga!

16
00:00:53,630 --> 00:00:55,970
Great, we've made up one goal.

17
00:00:56,550 --> 00:00:59,220
Ozora Tsubasa, Kojiro Hyuga.

18
00:00:59,310 --> 00:01:01,930
The first collaboration of the Super Golden Duo.

19
00:01:02,020 --> 00:01:05,400
They created a dream move from a spinning pass and a Tiger shot.

20
00:01:05,480 --> 00:01:07,480
Spinning Tiger Shot!

21
00:01:08,320 --> 00:01:09,980
Your shot was great, Hyuga-kun.

22
00:01:10,530 --> 00:01:12,490
Your pass was great too, Tsubasa.

23
00:01:33,840 --> 00:01:38,720
CAPTAIN TSUBASA: JUNIOR YOUTH ARC

24
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:58,960
Now Argentina restarts the game.

25
00:03:02,460 --> 00:03:05,340
Good luck, Argentina! It was only one goal!

26
00:03:05,420 --> 00:03:06,340
Don't worry.

27
00:03:06,750 --> 00:03:09,720
It seems the genius is worrying about that single goal!

28
00:03:13,930 --> 00:03:16,850
He passes Hyuga-kun with his special dribble.

29
00:03:17,270 --> 00:03:18,100
What!?

30
00:03:26,150 --> 00:03:27,110
Impossible.

31
00:03:27,190 --> 00:03:28,360
Impossible!

32
00:03:28,860 --> 00:03:33,160
He shows his genius and charges toward the goal.

33
00:03:33,820 --> 00:03:37,080
I've never seen such incredible dribbles.

34
00:03:40,250 --> 00:03:42,000
A-Amazing!

35
00:03:42,290 --> 00:03:44,000
This is...

36
00:03:44,250 --> 00:03:48,760
Diaz was just enjoying the game until now.

37
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:50,010
I've never seen him so serious.

38
00:03:52,510 --> 00:03:53,970
Bring it on, number 10.

39
00:03:54,050 --> 00:03:55,010
Diaz!

40
00:03:58,260 --> 00:04:01,020
What? Does he want to duel me?

41
00:04:01,230 --> 00:04:03,440
He gets past instantly with Tsubasa-kun's run.

42
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:06,020
He completely passes Tsubasa-kun.

43
00:04:06,270 --> 00:04:09,030
He got past Tsubasa very easily.

44
00:04:10,320 --> 00:04:11,530
Catch, Diaz.

45
00:04:12,030 --> 00:04:13,030
Good.

46
00:04:13,110 --> 00:04:15,530
Misaki from Japan intercepts.

47
00:04:15,780 --> 00:04:16,620
What?

48
00:04:16,700 --> 00:04:17,780
Damn it.

49
00:04:18,080 --> 00:04:19,160
Catch.

50
00:04:19,660 --> 00:04:23,040
Good, let's go!

51
00:04:23,750 --> 00:04:26,040
What a wonderful foot.

52
00:04:28,840 --> 00:04:32,550
Now Nitta from Japan takes a quick volley!

53
00:04:32,670 --> 00:04:37,300
Come on! The Unstoppable Falcon Shot!

54
00:04:39,260 --> 00:04:42,060
Oh, it hit the post, that was close.

55
00:04:42,390 --> 00:04:44,390
Another attempt from Japan but it wasn't a goal.

56
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:45,560
Damn it.

57
00:04:49,320 --> 00:04:52,780
Finally, they're playing their usual game again.

58
00:04:52,860 --> 00:04:56,570
Yes, and they quickly got used to Argentina.

59
00:04:59,410 --> 00:05:02,330
Since Tsubasa-kun has been able to control Diaz,

60
00:05:02,410 --> 00:05:05,290
the team's rhythm is definitely better.

61
00:05:10,590 --> 00:05:12,590
Now it won't end without goals.

62
00:05:12,670 --> 00:05:15,840
Little time left in the first half, I trust you, Tsubasa.

63
00:05:16,590 --> 00:05:19,350
Diaz-kun runs and tries to intercept.

64
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:25,850
Both jump in the air at the same time.

65
00:05:25,940 --> 00:05:27,020
Number 10!

66
00:05:27,100 --> 00:05:27,850
Diaz!

67
00:05:33,530 --> 00:05:36,320
Tsubasa-kun hits the ball.

68
00:05:37,070 --> 00:05:39,280
He reacted faster than the genius Diaz-kun.

69
00:05:39,370 --> 00:05:40,200
Good.

70
00:05:40,280 --> 00:05:44,870
This is the genius of Japanese football, Ozora Tsubasa.

71
00:05:45,460 --> 00:05:47,290
Diaz lost.

72
00:05:47,370 --> 00:05:50,000
That was a one-on-one battle.

73
00:05:50,080 --> 00:05:51,630
I-Impossible!

74
00:05:52,170 --> 00:05:55,630
Misaki-kun gets the ball and advances by dribbling.

75
00:05:56,010 --> 00:05:57,510
Misaki-kun!

76
00:05:57,590 --> 00:05:59,640
Good! Come on, Misaki.

77
00:06:00,050 --> 00:06:02,970
It's been three years since I came to France with Taro.

78
00:06:03,060 --> 00:06:07,600
Three years ago this summer, we left Nankatsu city.

79
00:06:08,440 --> 00:06:11,110
Thanks to football in Nankatsu,

80
00:06:11,190 --> 00:06:14,730
he met his best friend, Tsubasa.

81
00:06:14,820 --> 00:06:19,570
But my selfishness separated them.

82
00:06:20,660 --> 00:06:23,830
But Taro never got angry.

83
00:06:24,540 --> 00:06:26,370
He was always kind.

84
00:06:27,830 --> 00:06:30,960
Even when Yumiko said she wanted custody of Taro,

85
00:06:30,960 --> 00:06:32,670
Yamaoka

86
00:06:31,420 --> 00:06:33,840
he insisted his surname was Misaki, not Yamaoka.

87
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:39,130
He always said Misaki Taro, my son.

88
00:06:41,470 --> 00:06:48,480
And I, because of my selfishness, brought Taro to France.

89
00:06:42,510 --> 00:06:46,020
Misaki Taro

90
00:06:59,610 --> 00:07:01,910
Argentina has strong players.

91
00:07:02,070 --> 00:07:04,620
But Misaki-kun alone disrupted Argentina.

92
00:07:05,490 --> 00:07:08,450
Get ready, Kazuo, Argentina is in chaos now.

93
00:07:08,540 --> 00:07:11,170
This is our last chance in the first half.

94
00:07:11,580 --> 00:07:12,540
Brother!

95
00:07:12,750 --> 00:07:13,670
Jito!

96
00:07:13,840 --> 00:07:15,040
Okay.

97
00:07:16,050 --> 00:07:19,090
It's finally time to try that technique.

98
00:07:19,510 --> 00:07:22,340
I will never let you pass, I'll crush you.

99
00:07:22,890 --> 00:07:23,850
Tsubasa-kun!

100
00:07:24,300 --> 00:07:27,850
Misaki-kun passes to Tsubasa-kun.

101
00:07:28,270 --> 00:07:31,020
Tsubasa, bring it in front of the goal.

102
00:07:34,400 --> 00:07:36,860
Okay, I trust you.

103
00:07:40,030 --> 00:07:41,320
Get ready, Jito!

104
00:07:41,400 --> 00:07:42,610
Okay!

105
00:07:49,370 --> 00:07:51,330
- Alright! - Let's go!

106
00:07:51,500 --> 00:07:52,460
Okay!

107
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:58,710
The Twin Space Storm is launched!

108
00:07:59,380 --> 00:08:01,970
They're launched forward at the same time!

109
00:08:02,970 --> 00:08:05,090
What is this?

110
00:08:10,520 --> 00:08:11,640
Catch it!

111
00:08:11,730 --> 00:08:13,060
Come on!

112
00:08:13,270 --> 00:08:15,100
Twin Shot!

113
00:08:20,940 --> 00:08:22,860
What!?

114
00:08:23,530 --> 00:08:27,330
Goal! Japan scores the second goal!

115
00:08:27,490 --> 00:08:31,330
The Tachibana brothers score together.

116
00:08:31,580 --> 00:08:33,830
Well done, Tachibana brothers!

117
00:08:34,040 --> 00:08:35,250
W-We did it!

118
00:08:35,330 --> 00:08:36,330
It's a goal!

119
00:08:36,500 --> 00:08:37,840
We did it!

120
00:08:43,760 --> 00:08:44,720
Tachibana!

121
00:08:45,590 --> 00:08:48,050
The whistle signals the end of the first half.

122
00:08:48,300 --> 00:08:50,100
But are they okay?

123
00:08:50,180 --> 00:08:52,730
They seemed to have fallen very hard.

124
00:08:52,890 --> 00:08:56,480
I think we still need to work on the landing.

125
00:08:56,900 --> 00:09:00,650
Yes, but we scored the goal.

126
00:09:00,730 --> 00:09:02,490
Now only one left.

127
00:09:03,030 --> 00:09:06,700
They head to the locker room with the help of their teammates.

128
00:09:06,820 --> 00:09:10,240
That was a courageous move that put their bodies at risk.

129
00:09:11,040 --> 00:09:16,290
When Diaz-kun scored 3 consecutive goals, we all thought it would continue.

130
00:09:16,370 --> 00:09:20,130
But Argentina must have been amazed by the Japanese resistance.

131
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:21,920
Damn it!

132
00:09:22,010 --> 00:09:24,510
Anyway, we're still 1 goal ahead.

133
00:09:31,390 --> 00:09:35,020
With this goal, who knows how the game will go.

134
00:09:35,390 --> 00:09:39,360
Japan is very resilient, they don't give up.

135
00:09:39,650 --> 00:09:42,150
Three goals and two assists.

136
00:09:42,400 --> 00:09:46,110
The battle between the two number 10s will decide the fate of the second half.

137
00:09:46,570 --> 00:09:50,120
What are you doing? You relied too much on Diaz.

138
00:09:50,620 --> 00:09:56,460
You are the representatives of Argentina, don't just rely on Diaz.

139
00:09:56,540 --> 00:09:58,960
Believe in yourselves more.

140
00:09:59,040 --> 00:10:00,130
Y-Yes coach.

141
00:10:00,500 --> 00:10:02,380
It's not their fault.

142
00:10:05,340 --> 00:10:09,640
If I had played better, we could have scored more than 3.

143
00:10:10,140 --> 00:10:11,970
The responsibility for what happens on the field

144
00:10:12,060 --> 00:10:15,270
belongs to me as captain.

145
00:10:15,560 --> 00:10:16,600
Diaz...

146
00:10:16,680 --> 00:10:22,270
Roberto Hongo's warning before the match was right.

147
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:26,030
I know you are of Japanese descent.

148
00:10:26,110 --> 00:10:29,360
So excuse me, but we will definitely beat Japan today.

149
00:10:29,950 --> 00:10:31,950
You are too confident.

150
00:10:32,240 --> 00:10:36,330
Do you think you won't lose as long as you have the genius Diaz?

151
00:10:36,410 --> 00:10:37,750
Something like that.

152
00:10:38,290 --> 00:10:42,840
But you shouldn't underestimate Japan and Tsubasa.

153
00:10:43,920 --> 00:10:46,880
Tsubasa gets stronger as things get harder.

154
00:10:46,960 --> 00:10:50,180
The more you pressure him, the more he shows his true power.

155
00:10:50,720 --> 00:10:53,640
I don't think this will be an easy match.

156
00:10:54,430 --> 00:10:56,100
Roberto.

157
00:10:56,180 --> 00:10:57,270
And...

158
00:10:57,810 --> 00:11:02,980
Tsubasa, just like Juan Diaz, is a football genius.

159
00:11:05,020 --> 00:11:09,860
I guess we don't yet know the full abilities of the number 10.

160
00:11:11,410 --> 00:11:13,120
Sorry, Diaz.

161
00:11:13,280 --> 00:11:15,990
I know we call ourselves Argentina's Golden Duo.

162
00:11:16,160 --> 00:11:19,500
But I can't keep up with your high speed.

163
00:11:19,910 --> 00:11:22,960
Don't worry about it, Pascal, just do your best.

164
00:11:23,170 --> 00:11:27,210
The strange thing is, that number 10 can keep up with me.

165
00:11:29,470 --> 00:11:31,930
Don't be so sad, guys.

166
00:11:32,010 --> 00:11:34,600
We're still 1 goal ahead.

167
00:11:34,680 --> 00:11:39,060
As long as the genius Diaz is here, Argentina doesn't lose.

168
00:11:39,140 --> 00:11:41,270
Now let's enjoy the game.

169
00:11:41,940 --> 00:11:45,650
For better or worse, this team depends on Diaz.

170
00:11:45,900 --> 00:11:48,440
It changes according to Diaz's emotions.

171
00:11:48,570 --> 00:11:51,030
I trust you for the second half, Diaz.

172
00:11:52,200 --> 00:11:55,200
The Tachibana brothers are out for the second half.

173
00:11:55,580 --> 00:11:57,790
Sano and Izawa, you replace them.

174
00:11:58,120 --> 00:11:59,120
Yes, coach.

175
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:01,500
You two go see the doctor.

176
00:12:01,580 --> 00:12:02,670
Yes, coach.

177
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:04,540
Sorry, guys.

178
00:12:04,630 --> 00:12:08,550
What are you saying? You scored a really valuable goal for us.

179
00:12:08,920 --> 00:12:11,720
Right, Masao-kun, Kazuo-kun.

180
00:12:11,800 --> 00:12:14,590
Let's learn from the Tachibana brothers' fighting spirit.

181
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:17,060
And let's attack again in the second half.

182
00:12:17,350 --> 00:12:18,850
Okay.

183
00:12:19,350 --> 00:12:20,810
- Right. - We'll make up the goal.

184
00:12:21,890 --> 00:12:24,650
A lot has happened since we came to Europe.

185
00:12:28,690 --> 00:12:33,820
Now the Japan team is not about individuals.

186
00:12:33,950 --> 00:12:36,200
We are now a united team.

187
00:12:37,080 --> 00:12:38,790
As long as we can keep this motivation,

188
00:12:38,870 --> 00:12:41,450
we have a chance in the second half.

189
00:12:41,830 --> 00:12:46,460
Tsubasa-kun, since you've been controlling Diaz, we've been playing better.

190
00:12:46,540 --> 00:12:48,420
Keep an eye on Diaz in the second half too.

191
00:12:48,500 --> 00:12:49,460
Okay.

192
00:12:49,550 --> 00:12:52,840
Your football genius is no less than Diaz's.

193
00:12:53,010 --> 00:12:54,510
Have confidence.

194
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:55,720
Misugi-kun.

195
00:12:56,970 --> 00:12:59,180
In the first match, Gino Hernandez,

196
00:12:59,640 --> 00:13:02,810
and then in the second match, Juan Diaz.

197
00:13:03,600 --> 00:13:05,900
They are valuable opponents.

198
00:13:09,070 --> 00:13:11,440
Defeating them

199
00:13:11,730 --> 00:13:14,990
will pave the way for me to become the world's best footballer.

200
00:13:17,700 --> 00:13:20,660
Let's do this! Let's go, guys!

201
00:13:20,740 --> 00:13:22,250
Okay.

202
00:13:21,450 --> 00:13:23,450
CAPTAIN TSUBASA: JUNIOR YOUTH ARC

203
00:13:27,730 --> 00:13:29,980
Born: July 28, Height: 167 cm, Weight: 55 kg, Blood Type: A

204
00:13:36,030 --> 00:13:42,990
Forward Nitta | Forward Hyuga
Midfielder Misaki | Midfielder Ozora
Midfielder Sano | Midfielder Izawa

205
00:13:46,080 --> 00:13:53,000
Forward Brannon | Forward Pascal
Midfielder Jettis | Midfielder Diaz
Midfielder Palas | Midfielder Ruggeri

206
00:13:53,340 --> 00:13:55,510
Good luck, Tsubasa-kun.

207
00:13:55,710 --> 00:13:59,720
The second half now begins with Argentina's kickoff.

208
00:14:02,800 --> 00:14:06,390
I've faced one of the strongest opponents on the world stage.

209
00:14:06,470 --> 00:14:09,020
Football genius Juan Diaz.

210
00:14:09,390 --> 00:14:11,310
The world doesn't need another genius.

211
00:14:11,400 --> 00:14:16,030
Juan Diaz is the only player who will take the title of world's number one.

212
00:14:16,280 --> 00:14:18,030
Bring it on, Diaz!

213
00:14:18,110 --> 00:14:19,530
Bring it on, number 10.

214
00:14:21,530 --> 00:14:27,540
Diaz-kun gets past Tsubasa-kun with a feint... oh,
but Tsubasa-kun is right behind him.

215
00:14:28,410 --> 00:14:30,290
Now he tries to force his way through.

216
00:14:30,710 --> 00:14:33,040
But Tsubasa-kun still hasn't given up the chase.

217
00:14:33,840 --> 00:14:35,840
Now they go head-to-head.

218
00:14:37,090 --> 00:14:39,050
They collide.

219
00:14:51,480 --> 00:14:54,360
Now, while falling, they execute a return shot.

220
00:14:54,440 --> 00:14:57,190
Their speed and skill are equal.

221
00:14:57,280 --> 00:15:00,780
This is a high-level duel, a duel between two geniuses.

222
00:15:01,700 --> 00:15:02,780
Diaz!

223
00:15:02,990 --> 00:15:04,160
Number 10!

224
00:15:09,410 --> 00:15:12,580
I haven't had this much fun in a game in a long time.

225
00:15:12,710 --> 00:15:16,340
Sano-kun entered the game and picked up the loose ball.

226
00:15:16,420 --> 00:15:18,420
- Great, Sano. - Catch.

227
00:15:18,670 --> 00:15:19,510
Good.

228
00:15:19,590 --> 00:15:22,680
The ball goes to Izawa-kun, who just entered the field.

229
00:15:23,130 --> 00:15:24,340
Izawa-kun.

230
00:15:24,430 --> 00:15:25,600
I'll never allow it.

231
00:15:25,680 --> 00:15:29,680
Tsubasa-kun goes to goal, but Diaz-kun has him marked.

232
00:15:30,730 --> 00:15:31,560
Misaki.

233
00:15:31,850 --> 00:15:36,020
Izawa-kun passes not to Tsubasa-kun, but to the open Misaki-kun.

234
00:15:36,110 --> 00:15:37,110
Good.

235
00:15:41,820 --> 00:15:42,820
Tsubasa-kun.

236
00:15:43,030 --> 00:15:45,200
Good! Come on, Misaki-kun.

237
00:15:45,370 --> 00:15:47,200
Tsubasa-kun fell into the trap.

238
00:15:47,490 --> 00:15:48,700
If you can pass, pass!

239
00:15:50,660 --> 00:15:53,540
Tsubasa-kun gets past with a flip and reverse flip.

240
00:15:57,210 --> 00:16:00,460
Diaz-kun also flips under Galvan-kun.

241
00:16:00,670 --> 00:16:02,420
Alright, catch.

242
00:16:03,930 --> 00:16:06,340
Tsubasa-kun jumps straight up in the air!

243
00:16:06,510 --> 00:16:09,720
This looks like the technique Diaz used to score the first goal.

244
00:16:10,600 --> 00:16:13,850
He's making the opponent's technique his own.

245
00:16:13,980 --> 00:16:15,690
Tsubasa at his best.

246
00:16:15,940 --> 00:16:21,940
Misaki-kun's cross to Tsubasa-kun, perfect timing.

247
00:16:22,240 --> 00:16:23,950
Tsubasa! Misaki!

248
00:16:24,490 --> 00:16:30,240
How easily he stole my technique, very powerful, but...

249
00:16:31,040 --> 00:16:33,370
The creator of the technique won't allow it.

250
00:16:33,450 --> 00:16:37,460
Diaz-kun jumps in the air and blocks, Japan can't score!

251
00:16:37,630 --> 00:16:39,210
Catch, goalkeeper.

252
00:16:40,340 --> 00:16:43,840
Diaz-kun passes to his goalkeeper while in the air!

253
00:16:44,090 --> 00:16:45,590
Great, Diaz.

254
00:16:46,970 --> 00:16:48,300
Good, attack!

255
00:16:48,390 --> 00:16:50,220
Let's show them Argentina's power.

256
00:16:50,560 --> 00:16:51,390
Okay!

257
00:16:51,470 --> 00:16:57,230
Argentina's offensive line, which previously crushed Italy, now attacks Japan.

258
00:16:57,350 --> 00:16:59,480
- Don't let them through! - We'll cut them off!

259
00:17:02,820 --> 00:17:06,110
Galvan-kun passes like lightning!

260
00:17:06,200 --> 00:17:08,110
He's making a giant dribble.

261
00:17:08,240 --> 00:17:10,870
Get out of the way, I'll handle it!

262
00:17:12,580 --> 00:17:15,870
Two giants collided, their strength is equal!

263
00:17:16,370 --> 00:17:18,750
Argentina picks up the loose ball.

264
00:17:18,830 --> 00:17:20,130
Catch, Pascal.

265
00:17:21,790 --> 00:17:22,630
Okay!

266
00:17:22,800 --> 00:17:24,130
Don't even dream of it!

267
00:17:25,130 --> 00:17:28,890
Forward Hyuga-kun turns back to the goal and clears the ball.

268
00:17:28,970 --> 00:17:32,140
All of Japan is defending!

269
00:17:32,510 --> 00:17:33,890
Great, Hyuga.

270
00:17:34,310 --> 00:17:36,520
The ball is still with us.

271
00:17:36,680 --> 00:17:40,520
Fans from both sides are shouting.

272
00:17:40,610 --> 00:17:42,610
Defend, hang in there Japan!

273
00:17:42,690 --> 00:17:44,530
Don't concede any more!

274
00:17:44,860 --> 00:17:46,650
Attack Argentina!

275
00:17:46,740 --> 00:17:48,530
Score one more!

276
00:17:48,780 --> 00:17:51,030
Argentina's winger...

277
00:17:51,120 --> 00:17:52,530
Catch, Pascal.

278
00:17:52,990 --> 00:17:55,450
...passes to Pascal in front of the goal.

279
00:17:55,540 --> 00:17:56,540
We'll stop him.

280
00:17:57,290 --> 00:18:00,290
Ishizaki-kun and Soda-kun block the path.

281
00:18:01,750 --> 00:18:03,750
Catch, Diaz.

282
00:18:03,840 --> 00:18:07,300
Oh, Pascal-kun passes back with a return kick.

283
00:18:10,430 --> 00:18:11,800
Come on!

284
00:18:13,010 --> 00:18:17,560
Diaz is a moment faster and takes his second Drive Shot of the day.

285
00:18:18,270 --> 00:18:21,060
Will Argentina extend the lead?

286
00:18:23,110 --> 00:18:25,780
Wakashimazu-kun stops it!

287
00:18:26,530 --> 00:18:29,610
But he can't stop the spin of the ball.

288
00:18:31,860 --> 00:18:34,780
Wakashimazu-kun strikes the ball crosswise with his left hand!

289
00:18:34,870 --> 00:18:36,370
He cleared it.

290
00:18:36,450 --> 00:18:37,450
What!?

291
00:18:37,540 --> 00:18:38,710
Great, Wakashimazu.

292
00:18:38,870 --> 00:18:43,080
But again Argentina gets the loose ball.

293
00:18:43,170 --> 00:18:44,090
Pascal.

294
00:18:44,340 --> 00:18:45,800
Come on, Pascal.

295
00:18:46,170 --> 00:18:47,050
Catch.

296
00:18:50,340 --> 00:18:53,550
Diaz comes with a special heel shot!

297
00:18:58,810 --> 00:19:01,520
Wakashimazu-kun blocks it using the same technique!

298
00:19:01,600 --> 00:19:03,560
A heel kick.

299
00:19:07,280 --> 00:19:10,990
The power of Wakashimazu-kun's karate kick was stronger.

300
00:19:11,070 --> 00:19:12,780
They couldn't score another goal.

301
00:19:12,860 --> 00:19:15,320
Wakashimazu-kun saved the goal.

302
00:19:15,700 --> 00:19:18,330
Finally, the ball came under Japan's control.

303
00:19:18,450 --> 00:19:19,500
Catch him.

304
00:19:19,620 --> 00:19:20,830
Catch him.

305
00:19:21,460 --> 00:19:22,830
Impossible.

306
00:19:25,840 --> 00:19:29,340
Three players surround him, but he protects the ball.

307
00:19:29,510 --> 00:19:33,890
He is Hikaru Matsuyama, the number one in ball keeping.

308
00:19:36,260 --> 00:19:37,350
Good.

309
00:19:37,470 --> 00:19:39,270
The Japan team enters the opponent's territory.

310
00:19:39,350 --> 00:19:41,060
The Argentina team rushes back.

311
00:19:41,140 --> 00:19:42,100
Tsubasa-san.

312
00:19:42,310 --> 00:19:45,270
The ball goes to control tower Tsubasa-kun.

313
00:19:45,360 --> 00:19:46,190
Tsubasa-kun.

314
00:19:46,270 --> 00:19:47,770
Catch, Misaki-kun.

315
00:19:48,780 --> 00:19:50,860
This is a pass for Misaki-kun.

316
00:19:51,400 --> 00:19:52,860
I'll never let you through.

317
00:19:53,110 --> 00:19:57,120
Misaki-kun reads his movement and passes back to Hyuga-kun.

318
00:19:57,410 --> 00:20:00,120
Great, Misaki, now I'll score.

319
00:20:00,200 --> 00:20:01,620
I won't allow it.

320
00:20:03,830 --> 00:20:05,040
What?

321
00:20:05,120 --> 00:20:09,750
I won't let our attack, our chance to score, go to waste!

322
00:20:11,880 --> 00:20:13,380
Catch, Tsubasa.

323
00:20:13,470 --> 00:20:14,510
Hyuga-kun.

324
00:20:18,350 --> 00:20:21,890
Wakashimazu-kun saved us from Diaz's two shots.

325
00:20:22,640 --> 00:20:26,230
Matsuyama-kun protected the ball and opened a path for Hyuga.

326
00:20:27,400 --> 00:20:32,360
His shot was blocked but he managed to pass to me.

327
00:20:33,320 --> 00:20:36,360
If I don't turn this shot into a goal...

328
00:20:37,870 --> 00:20:39,660
I'm not a man!

329
00:20:39,910 --> 00:20:41,660
I won't allow it!

330
00:20:44,710 --> 00:20:47,330
Diaz... but this ball...

331
00:20:47,420 --> 00:20:48,670
Tsubasa-kun.

332
00:20:52,550 --> 00:20:53,420
Taro!

333
00:20:53,630 --> 00:20:55,170
Please, Misaki-kun.

334
00:20:58,090 --> 00:21:04,560
Taro's pure heart and Tsubasa's unwavering determination, all for football.

335
00:21:04,730 --> 00:21:07,020
Your pass was great, Tsubasa-kun.

336
00:21:08,190 --> 00:21:10,020
Despite being apart,

337
00:21:10,110 --> 00:21:15,820
their hearts never changed and they reunited to form this unity!

338
00:21:17,530 --> 00:21:20,530
Goal!

339
00:21:20,700 --> 00:21:24,080
Misaki-kun's jumping shot scores this goal.

340
00:21:24,540 --> 00:21:27,830
They are truly Japan's Golden Duo.

341
00:21:28,120 --> 00:21:29,330
You did it, Misaki.

342
00:21:29,420 --> 00:21:31,090
That was a beautiful shot, Misaki-kun.

343
00:21:31,380 --> 00:21:32,840
Your shot was great!

344
00:21:33,090 --> 00:21:35,130
Your shot was great, Misaki-kun.

345
00:21:35,210 --> 00:21:36,840
Your pass was great too, Tsubasa-kun.

346
00:21:36,920 --> 00:21:39,260
You did it, Tsubasa, Misaki!

347
00:21:39,340 --> 00:21:40,390
We tied it!

348
00:21:40,470 --> 00:21:41,850
We caught up to them!

349
00:21:42,010 --> 00:21:47,850
With the extraordinary efforts of the Golden Duo, Japan now makes it 3-3.

350
00:21:48,440 --> 00:21:53,730
Nankatsu's Golden Duo, now Japan's Golden Duo.

351
00:21:53,900 --> 00:21:56,110
Beautiful shot, Taro.

352
00:21:57,950 --> 00:21:59,070
Dad.

353
00:21:59,910 --> 00:22:03,990
Good luck, Taro. One more goal and you'll be in the top four.

354
00:22:04,790 --> 00:22:05,660
Yes.

355
00:23:46,000 --> 00:24:49,990
NEXT EPISODE: A BATTLE OF UPS AND DOWNS